"""
PRISM Experiment Suite
=======================
Reproduces all experiments reported in the paper:

    "PRISM: A Fraud-Resistant Design Framework for Mobile-First
     Referral Programmes in Developing Markets"

Experiments
-----------
1. Learned weights (PRISM-LR via logistic regression, 5-fold CV)
2. Baseline comparison: Rule-based / PRISM-LR / RF / XGBoost /
                        Isolation Forest / One-Class SVM
3. Ablation study: remove each pillar, measure F1 drop
4. Robustness sweep: fraud rate 5% / 10% / 20% / 30%
5. Publication figures (saved to figures/)
6. LaTeX results tables (saved to docs/)

Usage
-----
    python run_experiments.py               # full run (≈15 min)
    python run_experiments.py --quick       # skip robustness sweep
    python run_experiments.py --seed 123    # different random seed

Requirements
------------
    pip install numpy pandas networkx scikit-learn matplotlib seaborn xgboost
"""

